      "content": "<h3>contains, indexOf and lastIndexOf</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Signature:</strong> <code>boolean contains(Object o);  int indexOf(Object o);  int lastIndexOf(Object o)</code></li>\n<li><strong>Returns:</strong> <code>true</code> / the index / the index (or <code>-1</code>)</li>\n<li><strong>Time:</strong> O(n)</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>For freshers:</strong> Search by value from the front (<code>indexOf</code>, <code>contains</code>) or from the back (<code>lastIndexOf</code>). Matching uses <code>equals()</code>.</p>\n<p><strong>For experienced developers:</strong> Linear scans, identical in behaviour to ArrayList. Override <code>equals</code> in your element class (or use a <code>record</code>) so the search works for your objects.</p>",
